    {
      "id": "l1-greetings",
      "title": "Hellos, Thanks & Goodbyes",
      "objective": "Greet people, thank them, apologise politely and say goodbye.",
      "tips": [
        "\"Shukriya\" is the everyday \"thank you\". Many Pakistanis also simply say \"thank you\" in English.",
        "For goodbye you will hear both \"Khuda hafiz\" and \"Allah hafiz\". Both are normal; follow what the people around you use."
      ],
      "phrases": [
        {
