          "en": "I know a little Urdu.",
          "roman": "Mujhe thori Urdu aati hai.",
          "urdu": "مجھے تھوڑی اردو آتی ہے۔",
          "accept": [
            "mujhe thodi urdu aati hai",
            "mujhe thori si urdu aati hai",
            "mujhe thori urdu ati hai"
          ],
          "literal": "to me a little Urdu comes",
          "note": "\"Thori\" and \"aati\" are feminine because Urdu (the language) is feminine. It is the same for every speaker.",
